{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub004_researcher_01",
      "hash": "f8efdbb21431436a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "噓～！\\n告訴[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一個秘密。\\c\\n我推測這琥珀裡頭\\n保留著寶可夢的基因！\\c\\n要是能使牠復活過來的話，\\n那將會是寶可夢的一大發現！\\c\\n可是，同事們都不相信我的話。\\c\\n……所以，\\n我有事想拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\c\\n麻煩[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳找個研究所\\n把這個琥珀帶去，\\c\\n請人幫忙調查一下吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub004_sys_01",
      "hash": "827fc4a0dee6a71f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 1]"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub004_researcher_02",
      "hash": "f8efdab2143141b7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……噓！\\n琥珀就拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub004_researcher_03",
      "hash": "f8efd9b214314004",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯嗯！那隻化石翼龍\\n莫非是從琥珀中復活過來的嗎！？\\c\\n謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳幫我\\n證實了我的推論！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub004_researcher_04",
      "hash": "f8efd8b214313e51",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "基因很有趣吧！？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要不要也來學習一下？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_studym1_02_p04_t003_r0101",
      "hash": "c914d89d6dd1920f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    }
  ],
